# Lich Nexus (biome: lich_nexus)
# Symbols: % = nexus wall  . = obsidian floor  + = start
#   $ = wall-mounted glowing skull ([tile:skull]) - placeholder mood until the
#   proper nexus decor set exists; the geometry leaves slots for it everywhere.
# Monster spawns: q = lich   k = lich king   r = revenant
#
# THE DESCENT: entrance -> the GALLERY OF SKULLS, a one-wide stair with a
# revenant on the steps and skull pairs at its mouth -> the NORTH HALL:
#   west chapel - a lich's cell        east chapel - the watch (lich + guard)
# -> the RING: two side stairs (x10 / x22) around the sanctum -> THE SANCTUM:
# west and east doors, each flanked by a mounted skull; the lich king waits
# between two revenant heralds; a third skull watches the hall door outside.
# -> the SOUTH HALL: west chapel - a lich's cell; east chapel - the OSSUARY
# (revenants only; its blind east end is a reserved secret slot)
# -> the exit portal chamber at the far south.
