%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%+%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%.....%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%$...$%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%  >[tile:skull], [tile:skull]
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%...%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%.%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%.%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%.%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%.%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
